## Naming convention

`P.{{ lab|upper }}-{{ stamp }}-V{{ version | default(1, true) }}_<Topic>.docx`:
`P.` prefix, lab tag, hyphen, batch stamp, hyphen, version, underscore, CamelCase
topic, extension.

